<title>USA: Keycorp Q1 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Keycorp Q1 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.96		    $0.88</p>
<p> Net			212,000		  208,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Q1 1997 net interest income was $700 million, vs $682 million for Q1 1996.</p>
<p>Return on average total assets for Q1 1997 was 1.30 percent, vs 1.28 percent for Q1 1996.</p>
<p>Net loan charge-offs for Q1 1997 were $67 million, vs $43 million for Q1 1996.</p>
<p>First Call Q1 1997 estimate was $0.97 per share.</p>
</text>
